  "releaseNotes": "v0.8.0: Embedded TR catalog grows to 45 entries (was 33). Adds t3521 (해외지수조회) + t3518 (해외실시간지수) + t3102 (뉴스본문) under /stock/investinfo, plus nine staged TRs — t1105 (피봇/디마크), t1305 (기간별주가), t1403 (신규상장), t1442 (신고/신저가), t1475 (체결강도추이), t1927 (공매도일별추이), t3401 (투자의견), t8425 (전체테마), t8428 (증시주변자금). LsApiClient continuation now populates body cursor fields (LsTrResponse.ContinuationKeys) from the catalog's key_fields even for TRs that page by tr_cont header — pure body-paged and pure header-paged TRs are unaffected. Backs the Mcp package's v0.8 wrappers (ls_get_global_market_quote / ls_get_analyst_opinions / ls_get_short_selling_trend / ls_get_market_funds_trend / ls_get_high_low_stocks). Lockstep version bump with RedoxNet.Mcp.LsOpenApi 0.8.0. See https://github.com/redoxnet/mcp-lsopenapi/blob/main/RELEASENOTES.Core.md for full notes.",
